!-- 近隣・隣接都道府県の人気特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-orange-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-orange-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>🚗</span> 周遊・隣接エリアのおすすめ特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/yamagata-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【山形県】【2026年最新】山形おすすめ温泉旅館・ホテル10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">山形県全域（銀山温泉・蔵王温泉・かみのやま・米沢・庄内鶴岡）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/fukushima-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【福島県】【2026年最新】福島おすすめホテル・名湯温泉旅館10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">福島県全域（会津若松・東山芦ノ牧・猪苗代裏磐梯・いわきハワイアンズ・高湯飯坂）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/gunma-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【群馬県】【2026年最新】群馬おすすめ名湯温泉旅館10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">群馬県全域（草津温泉・伊香保温泉・みなかみ温泉郷・四万温泉）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/toyama-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\